        "title": "How you get in",
        "body": "A B.Sc with biology subjects. Routes include GAT-B (by NTA, for DBT-supported biotechnology programmes), IIT JAM (Biotechnology) for IITs and some other institutes, CUET-PG for central universities, and university / state tests."
      }
